 "en": {
  "name": "Variable-speed motor",
  "description": "Arduino Uno, a DC motor driven by an L298N powered by a 9 V battery, and a potentiometer to set the speed. The battery, the driver and the board share a common ground. Program: the potentiometer position sets the motor speed."
 },
